AF0 SWD/JTAG signal names are added by PCB Tester where the Cube-derived
tables omit the reset function. The "ft" flag marks GPIO pins. On the
shipped STM32H743 packages those I/Os are 5 V tolerant per the datasheet
I/O-structure column; power pins are not.
